### 1.5 🔴 No Connection Pooling Configuration

**File**: [database.py](file:///Users/vaxdsav/lignuaverse/backend/database.py) (line 11)

```python
engine = create_engine(DATABASE_URL)
```

Default SQLAlchemy pool has `pool_size=5`, `max_overflow=10`. Under concurrent load, connections will be exhausted and requests will hang or fail.

**Risk**: Under moderate concurrent load (>15 simultaneous requests), DB connections are exhausted, causing timeouts and 500 errors.

**Fix**:
```python
engine = create_engine(
    DATABASE_URL,
    pool_size=10,
    max_overflow=20,
    pool_pre_ping=True,       # Detects stale connections
    pool_recycle=300,          # Recycle connections every 5 min
    connect_args={"connect_timeout": 5}
)
```

